  "2026-08-20T20:11:36.876Z","harness:codex","Decision evidence: the prior global assertion was saturated at total blocks=243. Three evidence:pm-c90tfh rows raise total blocks to 246 while the derived uncited population remains 243 and the evidence partition is 3; this preserves both properties without headroom."
docs[1]{path,scope,note}:
